<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{title}} - Malha 3D</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;800&family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; background-color: #05070a; }
        .text-gradient { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff8c00, #00f2ff); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-6 overflow-hidden relative">
    <!-- Glow Orbs -->
    <div class="absolute top-[-200px] right-[-200px] w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-orange-500/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[-200px] left-[-200px] w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-cyan-500/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-xl w-full text-center relative z-10">
        <div class="bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-3xl border border-white/5 p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-2xl">
            <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-red-500/10 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center text-red-500 mx-auto mb-8 border border-red-500/20 shadow-xl shadow-red-500/5">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl">warning</span>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter mb-4">
                {{#if title}}{{title}}{{else}}Ops! Algo deu errado{{/if}}
            </h1>
            
            <p class="text-gray-400 font-medium text-lg mb-10 leading-relaxed">
                {{#if message}}{{message}}{{else}}Ocorreu um erro inesperado ao processar sua solicitação. Tente novamente em alguns instantes.{{/if}}
            </p>

            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
                <a href="/" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-orange-600 hover:scale-105 transition-all text-white font-black py-4 px-10 rounded-2xl shadow-xl shadow-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">home</span>
                    Voltar ao Início
                </a>
                <button onclick="history.back()" class="bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/10 text-gray-400 hover:text-white font-black py-4 px-10 rounded-2xl transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">arrow_back</span>
                    Página Anterior
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[10px] font-black text-gray-700 uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mt-12">Malha 3D // Neural Ecosystem Error Handler</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
